  "notes": "The only major-key model in this container: the research says major/mixolydian with I–IV and I–V–vi motion, and \"nursery-rhyme-simple melodic material **by design**\". That last clause is a parameter, not a description — `motifPitchCount` stays small, `intervals.step` is the highest here, `halfStepDissonance` bottoms out, and `chordToneBias` is near the ceiling, so the tune comes out singable rather than modal. `session.keys` is entirely major spellings and `scales` reaches outside crunk's four to `major`, `mixolydian` and `major_pentatonic`, which is a deliberate departure from the parent: this producer does not write the parent's harmony. Straight time with the backbeat on 2&4, kick on 1 and the \"&\" of 2 as written, and the hats are swung 16ths — `swing.amount` 0.58, classic MPC — with tambourine and handclaps standing. ⛔ `drums.bass808.role` moves off `bassline` because the research says a synth bass follows the loop with the 808 as reinforcement only; the `bassline` block is that synth bass, `mirror_kick` against the written kick with `followRootsProb` 0.78 so it tracks the loop rather than departing from it. `counter_riff` is the engine's only other 808 role and is a near-fit rather than a description. The melody is a call-and-response `structure` because the research says it supports a sung rap topline rather than carrying the record. ⚠ `low`, the research's medium-low: credits and era are documented, the paragraph says the parameters are inferred, and it marks the 88–100 band LOW-CONF. The perc lanes, the chord weights and the swing figure are INFERRED. ⚠ `fills.snareRollLadder` is off — with both fill periods at 4 bars the big fill wins and the inherited climbing ladder reads no seed, so it writes one identical fill on every one of 200. ⚠ **`lockTo808` raised from 0.4 to 0.47.** The 808 takes each kick with this probability, and at 0.4 over this model's 12-kick floor a seed could produce no 808 at all — which `bass808.rs` refuses, because a declared 808 that sometimes vanishes is a part a producer cannot rely on. It is still well under a lock: a good share of kicks carry no sub. ⚠ The bass ceiling came down from 52 to 51 so it stays under a chord part that starts at 52 — `coherence.rs` requires the highest bass note to sit at or below the lowest chord note, and this model overlapped by 1.",
